WEBVTT

1
00:01:49.523 --> 00:01:52.353
♪ Fly me to the moon ♪

2
00:01:49.523 --> 00:01:52.353
♪ 带我飞向月球 ♪

3
00:01:52.491 --> 00:01:55.563
♪ And let me play among the stars ♪

4
00:01:52.491 --> 00:01:55.563
♪ 让我在群星间嬉戏 ♪

5
00:01:57.531 --> 00:02:00.361
♪ Let me see what spring is like ♪

6
00:01:57.531 --> 00:02:00.361
♪ 让我看看春天是什么模样 ♪

7
00:02:00.499 --> 00:02:03.433
♪ On Jupiter and Mars ♪

8
00:02:00.499 --> 00:02:03.433
♪ 在木星和火星之上 ♪

9
00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:10.578
♪ In other words, please be true♪

10
00:02:04.917 --> 00:02:10.578
♪ 换句话说，请真诚以待 ♪

11
00:02:12.339 --> 00:02:14.341
♪ In another words♪

12
00:02:12.339 --> 00:02:14.341
♪ 换而言之 ♪

13
00:02:15.307 --> 00:02:16.239
♪ I...♪

14
00:02:15.307 --> 00:02:16.239
♪ 我... ♪

15
00:02:17.447 --> 00:02:19.311
♪ I love♪

16
00:02:17.447 --> 00:02:19.311
♪ 我爱 ♪

17
00:02:20.347 --> 00:02:21.244
♪ You♪

18
00:02:20.347 --> 00:02:21.244
♪ 你 ♪

19
00:02:21.382 --> 00:02:22.556
♪ You, you, and you♪

20
00:02:21.382 --> 00:02:22.556
♪ 你，你，还有你 ♪

21
00:02:22.694 --> 00:02:23.764
The three of us?

22
00:02:22.694 --> 00:02:23.764
我们三个？

23
00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:25.283
Let's give it up for Rich.

24
00:02:23.902 --> 00:02:25.283
让我们为里奇鼓掌。

25
00:02:25.421 --> 00:02:27.733
That one never gets old. He's talking to me not you.

26
00:02:25.421 --> 00:02:27.733
那个笑话永远听不腻。他是在跟我说话，不是跟你。

27
00:02:27.871 --> 00:02:29.597
Beautiful voice, Captain.

28
00:02:27.871 --> 00:02:29.597
声音真好听，机长。

29
00:02:29.735 --> 00:02:32.152
So good.

30
00:02:29.735 --> 00:02:32.152
太棒了。

31
00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.222
You are terrible.

32
00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.222
你真坏。

33
00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.396
You know what I'm terrible at?

34
00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:35.396
你知道我最不擅长什么吗？

35
00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:36.708
Marriage.

36
00:02:35.534 --> 00:02:36.708
婚姻。

37
00:02:36.846 --> 00:02:38.399
I'm pretty good at first dates.

38
00:02:36.846 --> 00:02:38.399
初次约会我倒挺在行的。

39
00:03:07.221 --> 00:03:08.498
Hey, honey.

40
00:03:07.221 --> 00:03:08.498
嘿，亲爱的。

41
00:03:08.636 --> 00:03:10.569
- Oh, thank God. - I thought we missed you.

42
00:03:08.636 --> 00:03:10.569
- 哦，谢天谢地。 - 我还以为我们错过你了。

43
00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:12.709
I got your message.

44
00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:12.709
我收到你的消息了。

45
00:03:12.847 --> 00:03:14.539
Yeah, they changed the roster.

46
00:03:12.847 --> 00:03:14.539
是啊，他们改了排班表。

47
00:03:15.643 --> 00:03:16.748
When are you coming back?

48
00:03:15.643 --> 00:03:16.748
你什么时候回来？

49
00:03:18.819 --> 00:03:20.786
Babe, I'll send you a new schedule when I get it.

50
00:03:18.819 --> 00:03:20.786
宝贝，我拿到新排班表就发给你。

51
00:03:20.924 --> 00:03:23.237
Ben, I know you're hurting.

52
00:03:20.924 --> 00:03:23.237
本，我知道你很难过。

53
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:24.894
We both are.

54
00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:24.894
我们都很难过。

55
00:03:25.032 --> 00:03:26.930
But you can't keep running away from that.

56
00:03:25.032 --> 00:03:26.930
但你不能一直逃避这件事。

57
00:03:27.621 --> 00:03:28.553
Hold on, babe.

58
00:03:27.621 --> 00:03:28.553
坚持住，亲爱的。

59
00:03:29.968 --> 00:03:31.935
Hey, Lisa, you found me something.

60
00:03:29.968 --> 00:03:31.935
嘿，丽莎，你帮我找到活儿了。

61
00:03:32.073 --> 00:03:34.766
There's a LA-Shanghai route, but I don't know, it's leaving soon.

62
00:03:32.073 --> 00:03:34.766
有条从洛杉矶飞上海的航线，但我不太确定，航班很快就要起飞了。

63
00:03:34.904 --> 00:03:36.043
All right, I'll take it.

64
00:03:34.904 --> 00:03:36.043
行，我接了。

65
00:03:36.181 --> 00:03:37.147
You won't have time to go home.

66
00:03:36.181 --> 00:03:37.147
你没时间回家了。

67
00:03:37.286 --> 00:03:38.908
Doesn't matter. I'll take it.

68
00:03:37.286 --> 00:03:38.908
没关系，我拿着就行。

69
00:03:39.046 --> 00:03:40.668
Hey, I got Nadine on the other line.

70
00:03:39.046 --> 00:03:40.668
嘿，纳丁打另一条线过来了。

71
00:03:40.806 --> 00:03:41.911
I'll call you back, all right?

72
00:03:40.806 --> 00:03:41.911
我待会儿打给你，行吗？

73
00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.918
Honey?

74
00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.918
亲爱的？

75
00:03:49.056 --> 00:03:50.022
- Mom, where are you? - Our son is sick, Ben.

76
00:03:49.056 --> 00:03:50.022
- 妈，你在哪儿？ - 咱们儿子病了，本。

77
00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.714
He needs you here.

78
00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.714
他需要你在这儿。

79
00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:53.233
- Oh, I gotta go. - Mom!

80
00:03:51.852 --> 00:03:53.233
- 哦，我得走了。 - 妈妈！

81
00:03:53.371 --> 00:03:54.786
- Nadine... - Sean's calling.

82
00:03:53.371 --> 00:03:54.786
- 纳丁…… - 肖恩在打电话。

83
00:04:15.013 --> 00:04:17.291
Ow. Sir? You can't smoke here.

84
00:04:15.013 --> 00:04:17.291
哎哟。先生？这里不能吸烟。

85
00:04:18.188 --> 00:04:19.362
Cinemas, planes, bars.

86
00:04:18.188 --> 00:04:19.362
电影院、飞机上、酒吧里。

87
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.503
Now I can't even smoke outside without being harassed by the fun police.

88
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.503
现在连在外面抽烟都要被那些扫兴警察似的管着。

89
00:04:22.641 --> 00:04:24.056
Come on. Sir.

90
00:04:22.641 --> 00:04:24.056
来吧，先生。

91
00:04:24.194 --> 00:04:26.231
The designated smoking areas are located right over there.

92
00:04:24.194 --> 00:04:26.231
指定的吸烟区就在那边。

93
00:04:44.732 --> 00:04:46.147
Fuck!

94
00:04:44.732 --> 00:04:46.147
妈的！

95
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.604
Hey, Rich.

96
00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.604
嘿，里奇。

97
00:04:56.434 --> 00:04:57.952
It looks like I'm your right seat to Shanghai.

98
00:04:56.434 --> 00:04:57.952
看来我是你飞上海的副驾驶了。

99
00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.091
Been a while.

100
00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.091
好久不见。

101
00:04:59.229 --> 00:05:00.265
I heard you're hanging it up.

102
00:04:59.229 --> 00:05:00.265
听说你要退休了。

103
00:05:00.403 --> 00:05:01.231
Thank you. Here you go.

104
00:05:00.403 --> 00:05:01.231
谢谢。给你。

105
00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.302
Penny... Hey.

106
00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:02.302
佩妮……嘿。

107
00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.373
...you missed karaoke night.

108
00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.373
……你错过了卡拉 OK 之夜。

109
00:05:04.511 --> 00:05:06.202
I hear you sang that same song again.

110
00:05:04.511 --> 00:05:06.202
我听说你又唱了那首老歌。

111
00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.687
Damn. Did it work?

112
00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.687
靠。管用了吗？

113
00:05:08.825 --> 00:05:10.724
It always works.

114
00:05:08.825 --> 00:05:10.724
总是管用。

115
00:05:10.862 --> 00:05:12.691
Thank you.

116
00:05:10.862 --> 00:05:12.691
谢谢。

117
00:05:12.829 --> 00:05:14.969
Sorry, sir, please step this way.

118
00:05:12.829 --> 00:05:14.969
抱歉，先生，请往这边走。

119
00:05:15.107 --> 00:05:16.695
Hell.

120
00:05:15.107 --> 00:05:16.695
该死。

121
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.629
I've got a random. Meet you guys at the gate.

122
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.629
我随机选了一个。咱们登机口见。

123
00:05:20.492 --> 00:05:21.493
Go ahead. Go ahead.

124
00:05:20.492 --> 00:05:21.493
你先走。你先走。

125
00:05:21.631 --> 00:05:22.632
How you doing, Penny?

126
00:05:21.631 --> 00:05:22.632
你好吗，佩妮？

127
00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:23.702
Good. How are you?

128
00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:23.702
挺好的。你呢？

129
00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.670
You trust me to captain a plane.

130
00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.670
你信任我当机长。

131
00:05:25.808 --> 00:05:27.465
You worried about my toothpaste.

132
00:05:25.808 --> 00:05:27.465
你却担心我的牙膏。

133
00:05:28.569 --> 00:05:30.019
Any batteries or power banks?

134
00:05:28.569 --> 00:05:30.019
有携带电池或充电宝吗？

135
00:05:30.882 --> 00:05:31.745
Sir?

136
00:05:30.882 --> 00:05:31.745
先生？

137
00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.506
Uh, no.

138
00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:34.506
呃，不。

139
00:05:34.644 --> 00:05:37.785
Sure I can't get upgraded? I'm a gold member, you know.

140
00:05:34.644 --> 00:05:37.785
真的不能升舱吗？我可是金卡会员。

141
00:05:44.689 --> 00:05:46.276
I don't want to.

142
00:05:44.689 --> 00:05:46.276
我不想。

143
00:05:46.415 --> 00:05:48.140
You know how I get with flying.

144
00:05:46.415 --> 00:05:48.140
你知道我坐飞机时是什么样。

145
00:05:48.278 --> 00:05:50.004
Okay, look, do we have to do this here?

146
00:05:48.278 --> 00:05:50.004
好吧，我们非得在这儿谈这个吗？

147
00:05:50.142 --> 00:05:51.040
- I don't want to. - Right here? Tell you what.

148
00:05:50.142 --> 00:05:51.040
- 我不想。 - 就在这儿？我跟你说。

149
00:05:51.178 --> 00:05:52.144
You don't get it.

150
00:05:51.178 --> 00:05:52.144
你不明白。

151
00:05:52.282 --> 00:05:54.768
The plane is bigger to Shanghai... No, they're not.

152
00:05:52.282 --> 00:05:54.768
去上海的飞机更大……不，不是的。

153
00:05:54.906 --> 00:05:56.079
...than the ones you've previously been on. Okay?

154
00:05:54.906 --> 00:05:56.079
……比你之前坐过的那些都要好，明白吗？

155
00:05:56.217 --> 00:05:58.081
That's something, right? You folks okay?

156
00:05:56.217 --> 00:05:58.081
这总归是好事，对吧？你们还好吗？

157
00:05:58.219 --> 00:06:01.015
Yeah, it's fine. My daughter doesn't like flying.

158
00:05:58.219 --> 00:06:01.015
嗯，没事。我女儿不太喜欢坐飞机。

159
00:06:01.153 --> 00:06:03.363
You know what's more dangerous than flying on an airplane?

160
00:06:01.153 --> 00:06:03.363
你知道比坐飞机更危险的是什么吗？

161
00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:06.262
Hippos.

162
00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:06.262
河马。

163
00:06:07.505 --> 00:06:09.645
No way. You made that up.

164
00:06:07.505 --> 00:06:09.645
不可能。你瞎编的吧。

165
00:06:09.783 --> 00:06:10.680
Google it.

166
00:06:09.783 --> 00:06:10.680
上网查查。

167
00:06:11.854 --> 00:06:13.269
You're gonna be fine.

168
00:06:11.854 --> 00:06:13.269
你会没事的。

169
00:06:13.407 --> 00:06:16.030
Unless someone smuggles a hippo onboard.

170
00:06:13.407 --> 00:06:16.030
除非有人偷运一头河马上飞机。

171
00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:17.480
Are you, like, a captain?

172
00:06:16.168 --> 00:06:17.480
你，呃，是机长吗？

173
00:06:19.965 --> 00:06:21.691
No, I'm a first officer.

174
00:06:19.965 --> 00:06:21.691
不，我是副驾驶。

175
00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.178
It's my job to make sure the captain flies straight.

176
00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.178
我的职责是确保机长飞得笔直。

177
00:06:26.316 --> 00:06:27.973
Aren't you too old not to be a captain?

178
00:06:26.316 --> 00:06:27.973
你这个年纪还没当上机长，不觉得太老了吗？

179
00:06:28.111 --> 00:06:29.527
- Cora!

180
00:06:28.111 --> 00:06:29.527
- 科拉！

181
00:06:29.665 --> 00:06:31.149
Tough, huh? Yeah.

182
00:06:29.665 --> 00:06:31.149
挺难熬的，是吧？是啊。

183
00:06:31.287 --> 00:06:41.055
Uh, well, Cora... sometimes in life... you gotta take a few detours to get where you're going.

184
00:06:31.287 --> 00:06:41.055
呃，那个，科拉……有时候人生就是这样……得绕点弯路才能到达目的地。

185
00:06:41.193 --> 00:06:42.505
You ever had to take a detour?

186
00:06:41.193 --> 00:06:42.505
你曾经不得不绕道而行吗？

187
00:06:42.643 --> 00:06:44.611
No, I'm extremely punctual.

188
00:06:42.643 --> 00:06:44.611
不，我向来准时。

189
00:06:46.164 --> 00:06:47.441
Good girl.

190
00:06:46.164 --> 00:06:47.441
好姑娘。

191
00:06:48.304 --> 00:06:49.892
She's tough.

192
00:06:48.304 --> 00:06:49.892
她很强硬。

193
00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.341
- I know, thank you. - Cora.

194
00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.341
- 我知道，谢谢。 - 科拉。

195
00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.620
Cora, Cora, Cora, look. Look what Mama got me.

196
00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.620
科拉，科拉，科拉，你看。看妈妈给我买了什么。

197
00:06:53.758 --> 00:06:55.760
Hey, guys. Look, look.

198
00:06:53.758 --> 00:06:55.760
嘿，各位。快看，快看。

199
00:06:55.898 --> 00:06:57.382
Could that thing be any louder?

200
00:06:55.898 --> 00:06:57.382
那玩意儿能再吵点吗？

201
00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.556
I know. Cool, right?

202
00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:58.556
我知道。很酷，对吧？

203
00:06:58.694 --> 00:07:00.420
And I got a new battery for this.

204
00:06:58.694 --> 00:07:00.420
我还给它换了个新电池。

205
00:07:02.594 --> 00:07:03.871
Okay, there we go.

206
00:07:02.594 --> 00:07:03.871
好了，搞定了。

207
00:07:04.009 --> 00:07:05.355
Just put a pet chip in his neck.

208
00:07:04.009 --> 00:07:05.355
只是在他脖子里植入了宠物芯片。

209
00:07:06.943 --> 00:07:08.013
- Uh... - Cora, do you mind?

210
00:07:06.943 --> 00:07:08.013
- 呃…… - 科拉，你介意吗？

211
00:07:09.705 --> 00:07:11.154
I was doing something. I'll give it back.

212
00:07:09.705 --> 00:07:11.154
我刚才在忙事情。我会还回去的。

213
00:07:11.292 --> 00:07:12.604
Just hang on.

214
00:07:11.292 --> 00:07:12.604
再等一下。

215
00:07:12.742 --> 00:07:14.882
The password's his birthday.

216
00:07:12.742 --> 00:07:14.882
密码是他的生日。

217
00:07:18.196 --> 00:07:21.613
Listen, Cora, honey, we're gonna need you to look out for your brother on this trip, okay?

218
00:07:18.196 --> 00:07:21.613
听着，科拉，亲爱的，这次旅行你得照顾好你弟弟，好吗？

219
00:07:21.751 --> 00:07:23.443
Step-brother.

220
00:07:21.751 --> 00:07:23.443
继弟。

221
00:07:30.035 --> 00:07:31.865
- That's it. - That's the last of this.

222
00:07:30.035 --> 00:07:31.865
- 就这些了。- 这是最后一件。

223
00:07:35.247 --> 00:07:36.076
Load it up.

224
00:07:35.247 --> 00:07:36.076
装上去吧。

225
00:07:41.115 --> 00:07:42.220
Thank you.

226
00:07:41.115 --> 00:07:42.220
谢谢。

227
00:07:42.358 --> 00:07:48.053
Northeastern Airlines Flight N-140 to Shanghai - will now begin boarding. - Hey, hey!

228
00:07:42.358 --> 00:07:48.053
东北航空飞往上海的 N-140 次航班——现在开始登机。- 嘿，嘿！

229
00:07:48.191 --> 00:07:49.848
Don't you dare puke on me, bro.

230
00:07:48.191 --> 00:07:49.848
你小子可别吐我身上，兄弟。

231
00:07:49.986 --> 00:07:51.540
I'll drop your drunk ass right here.

232
00:07:49.986 --> 00:07:51.540
信不信我把你这个醉鬼直接扔这儿。

233
00:07:51.678 --> 00:07:52.886
I'm not playing, Hutch.

234
00:07:51.678 --> 00:07:52.886
我可不是闹着玩的，哈奇。

235
00:07:56.441 --> 00:07:57.856
Oh gosh, Esports.

236
00:07:56.441 --> 00:07:57.856
哦天哪，电竞啊。

237
00:07:57.994 --> 00:08:00.238
Playing video games isn't a real sport.

238
00:07:57.994 --> 00:08:00.238
打电子游戏哪算得上真正的运动。

239
00:08:00.376 --> 00:08:05.830
It's a bunch of losers kicking it in Mommy's basement with bags of Doritos and... Oh, I'm sorry. Excuse me.

240
00:08:00.376 --> 00:08:05.830
不过是一群窝在妈妈家地下室的失败者，抱着多力多滋薯片袋……哦，抱歉，失陪一下。

241
00:08:05.968 --> 00:08:07.348
Ooh. What's up, Esports?

242
00:08:05.968 --> 00:08:07.348
