00:12:07.692 --> 00:12:08.831
I'd rat you out.

358
00:12:07.692 --> 00:12:08.831
我会告发你。

359
00:12:08.969 --> 00:12:09.970
I know you would.

360
00:12:08.969 --> 00:12:09.970
我知道你会。

361
00:12:17.357 --> 00:12:19.117
No ice? Mmm-hmm.

362
00:12:17.357 --> 00:12:19.117
不加冰？嗯哼。

363
