Heard he's been pretty sick lately.

374
00:13:16.968 --> 00:13:18.798
听说他最近病得不轻。

375
00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.529
Must be tough on your wife, especially when you're working and all.

376
00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.529
你妻子肯定很辛苦，尤其是你还在工作的时候。

377
00:13:26.667 --> 00:13:28.808
Yeah, well, Nadine's family lives nearby.

378
00:13:26.667 --> 00:13:28.808
是啊，好在纳丁的家人就住在附近。

379
