1225
00:53:01.316 --> 00:53:02.420
Open your eyes, dumbass.

1226
00:53:01.316 --> 00:53:02.420
睁开眼，蠢货。

1227
00:53:02.558 --> 00:53:04.111
Can't you see the steward's totally fried?

1228
00:53:02.558 --> 00:53:04.111
你没看到空乘完全吓傻了吗？

1229
00:53:04.250 --> 00:53:06.079
Just leave her alone, okay? She's in shock.

1230
00:53:04.250 --> 00:53:06.079
别管她了，行吗？她吓懵了。

1231
00:53:06.873 --> 00:53:08.771
Let me help you, okay?

1232
00:53:06.873 --> 00:53:08.771
让我来帮你，好吗？

1233
00:53:08.909 --> 00:53:11.809
Are you a doctor? No, I'm a veterinarian.

1234
00:53:08.909 --> 00:53:11.809
你是医生吗？不，我是兽医。

1235
00:53:11.947 --> 00:53:13.328
Great.

1236
00:53:11.947 --> 00:53:13.328
太好了。

1237
00:53:13.466 --> 00:53:15.985
Put a cone on her. Stop her from licking herself.

1238
00:53:13.466 --> 00:53:15.985
给她戴上伊丽莎白圈，别让她舔自己。

1239
00:53:16.123 --> 00:53:18.022
See, that's why I prefer animals to humans.

1240
00:53:16.123 --> 00:53:18.022
看吧，这就是为什么比起人类我更喜欢动物。

1241
00:53:22.785 --> 00:53:23.959
We don't have much time.

1242
00:53:22.785 --> 00:53:23.959
我们时间不多了。

1243
00:53:24.097 --> 00:53:25.132
Shut up. Just shut up.

1244
00:53:24.097 --> 00:53:25.132
闭嘴。给我闭嘴。

1245
00:53:25.271 --> 00:53:26.513
- We will sink. - We are all going to die!

1246
00:53:25.271 --> 00:53:26.513
- 我们会沉下去的。 - 我们都要死了！

1247
00:53:26.651 --> 00:53:27.997
What do you expect us to do?

1248
00:53:26.651 --> 00:53:27.997
你指望我们做什么？

1249
00:53:28.135 --> 00:53:29.240
Move back.

1250
00:53:28.135 --> 00:53:29.240
后退。

1251
00:53:29.378 --> 00:53:30.931
To where? In the water.

1252
00:53:29.378 --> 00:53:30.931
退到哪里？水里吗。

1253
00:53:31.069 --> 00:53:32.554
Take some weight off.

1254
00:53:31.069 --> 00:53:32.554
减轻点重量。

1255
00:53:32.692 --> 00:53:35.453
The kid's right. There's a coral reef under us.

1256
00:53:32.692 --> 00:53:35.453
那孩子说得对。我们下面有片珊瑚礁。

1257
00:53:35.591 --> 00:53:37.386
It might take some pressure off it.

1258
00:53:35.591 --> 00:53:37.386
这或许能减轻一些压力。

1259
00:53:37.524 --> 00:53:38.456
You go then.

1260
00:53:37.524 --> 00:53:38.456
那你先上吧。

1261
00:53:38.594 --> 00:53:40.976
One person won't make a difference.

1262
00:53:38.594 --> 00:53:40.976
一个人改变不了什么。

1263
00:53:42.184 --> 00:53:43.289
What'd you just call me?

1264
00:53:42.184 --> 00:53:43.289
你刚才叫我什么？

1265
00:53:43.427 --> 00:53:45.532
What did he call me? All right, all right!

1266
00:53:43.427 --> 00:53:45.532
他叫我什么？好吧，好吧！

1267
00:53:45.670 --> 00:53:47.707
Knock it off, both of you.

1268
00:53:45.670 --> 00:53:47.707
你们两个，别闹了。

1269
00:53:47.845 --> 00:53:49.329
Esport is right.

1270
00:53:47.845 --> 00:53:49.329
埃斯波特说得对。

1271
00:53:50.261 --> 00:53:51.607
Now, come on.

1272
00:53:50.261 --> 00:53:51.607
好了，来吧。

1273
00:53:53.609 --> 00:53:55.232
Anybody else coming?

1274
00:53:53.609 --> 00:53:55.232
还有其他人要来吗？

1275
00:53:56.923 --> 00:53:58.165
Huh?

1276
00:53:56.923 --> 00:53:58.165
嗯？

1277
00:53:59.408 --> 00:54:01.824
- Whoa! - Hold up, Jesse. What?

1278
00:53:59.408 --> 00:54:01.824
- 哇！ - 等等，杰西。什么？

1279
00:54:01.962 --> 00:54:05.276
If this thing goes down, anyone's who's down there is gonna be stuck inside.

1280
00:54:01.962 --> 00:54:05.276
如果这东西掉下去，下面的人都会被困在里面。

1281
00:54:05.414 --> 00:54:06.381
Okay?

1282
00:54:05.414 --> 00:54:06.381
好吗？

1283
00:54:06.519 --> 00:54:08.072
Jesse, don't be stupid, bro.

1284
00:54:06.519 --> 00:54:08.072
杰西，别犯傻，老兄。

1285
00:54:08.210 --> 00:54:10.971
Some of these wounded and old people won't make it out there, man.

1286
00:54:08.210 --> 00:54:10.971
这些伤者和老人里，有些人撑不到外面的，兄弟。

1287
00:54:11.109 --> 00:54:13.422
Jesse, come back here. Jesse.

1288
00:54:11.109 --> 00:54:13.422
杰西，回来。杰西。

1289
00:54:16.874 --> 00:54:19.117
Let's go. Come on, come on.

1290
00:54:16.874 --> 00:54:19.117
走吧。快点，快点。

1291
00:54:21.188 --> 00:54:23.639
Everyone's going. Yeah, everyone's going.

1292
00:54:21.188 --> 00:54:23.639
大家都走了。是啊，大家都走了。

1293
00:54:23.777 --> 00:54:24.985
Go for it.

1294
00:54:23.777 --> 00:54:24.985
上吧。

1295
00:54:25.123 --> 00:54:26.918
Just breathe.

1296
00:54:25.123 --> 00:54:26.918
深呼吸。

1297
00:54:27.056 --> 00:54:30.267
Guess you ain't getting me that vodka soda anytime soon.

1298
00:54:27.056 --> 00:54:30.267
看来你一时半会儿是没法给我弄杯伏特加苏打水了。

1299
00:55:14.241 --> 00:55:15.588
Coach!

1300
00:55:14.241 --> 00:55:15.588
教练！

1301
00:55:16.796 --> 00:55:18.073
I got you!

1302
00:55:16.796 --> 00:55:18.073
我接住你了！

1303
00:55:18.211 --> 00:55:20.109
- Are you hurt? - Lisa. Lisa.

1304
00:55:18.211 --> 00:55:20.109
- 你受伤了吗？ - 丽莎。丽莎。

1305
00:55:20.247 --> 00:55:24.148
Lisa! Lisa.

1306
00:55:20.247 --> 00:55:24.148
丽莎！丽莎。

1307
00:55:24.286 --> 00:55:25.391
Is there anyone else?

1308
00:55:24.286 --> 00:55:25.391
还有其他人吗？

1309
00:55:25.529 --> 00:55:27.600
Coach! Coach!

1310
00:55:25.529 --> 00:55:27.600
教练！教练！

1311
00:55:31.466 --> 00:55:32.398
Coach!

1312
00:55:31.466 --> 00:55:32.398
教练！

1313
00:55:33.053 --> 00:55:34.261
No, no, no!

1314
00:55:33.053 --> 00:55:34.261
不，不，不！

1315
00:55:35.297 --> 00:55:37.092
Grab him, Jesse! Grab him!

1316
00:55:35.297 --> 00:55:37.092
抓住他，杰西！抓住他！

1317
00:55:49.138 --> 00:55:52.383
Move! Move!

1318
00:55:49.138 --> 00:55:52.383
快动！快动！

1319
00:55:52.521 --> 00:55:54.868
Coach! Jesse!

1320
00:55:52.521 --> 00:55:54.868
教练！杰西！

1321
00:55:58.182 --> 00:55:59.597
Come on.

1322
00:55:58.182 --> 00:55:59.597
来吧。

1323
00:56:00.633 --> 00:56:01.668
Hey, hey. Take it easy.

1324
00:56:00.633 --> 00:56:01.668
嘿，嘿。放轻松点。

1325
00:56:02.531 --> 00:56:04.222
You.

1326
00:56:02.531 --> 00:56:04.222
你。

1327
00:56:04.361 --> 00:56:06.915
Get in the water! Take it easy. Take it easy.

1328
00:56:04.361 --> 00:56:06.915
下水去！放轻松点。放轻松点。

1329
00:56:07.053 --> 00:56:08.744
- No, stop. - Get in the water!

1330
00:56:07.053 --> 00:56:08.744
- 不，住手！ - 下水去！

1331
00:56:08.882 --> 00:56:11.229
- No! - Get in... I didn't know! Get in the water!

1332
00:56:08.882 --> 00:56:11.229
- 不！ - 下去……我不知道！下水去！

1333
00:56:11.368 --> 00:56:13.370
Stop it! Stop it!

1334
00:56:11.368 --> 00:56:13.370
住手！住手！

1335
00:56:16.442 --> 00:56:19.237
Stop it! Stop it, please!

1336
00:56:16.442 --> 00:56:19.237
住手！求你了，住手！

1337
00:56:20.860 --> 00:56:22.965
Stop it! Hey! Hey!

1338
00:56:20.860 --> 00:56:22.965
住手！嘿！嘿！

1339
00:56:24.173 --> 00:56:26.866
How is this helping? Huh?

1340
00:56:24.173 --> 00:56:26.866
这有什么用？嗯？

1341
00:56:27.004 --> 00:56:28.661
Do you want to live?

1342
00:56:27.004 --> 00:56:28.661
你想活吗？

1343
00:56:28.799 --> 00:56:30.007
Do you?

1344
00:56:28.799 --> 00:56:30.007
想吗？

1345
00:56:32.423 --> 00:56:34.183
Yes. Yes.

1346
00:56:32.423 --> 00:56:34.183
是的。是的。

1347
00:56:34.321 --> 00:56:36.841
Then we need to keep our cool.

1348
00:56:34.321 --> 00:56:36.841
那我们得保持冷静。

1349
00:56:36.979 --> 00:56:38.256
Tell me we're gonna keep our cool.

1350
00:56:36.979 --> 00:56:38.256
告诉我我们会保持冷静。

1351
00:56:38.395 --> 00:56:40.017
I'm gonna keep my cool.

1352
00:56:38.395 --> 00:56:40.017
我会保持冷静的。

1353
00:56:49.820 --> 00:56:52.029
- Kid, have some nuts. - Good protein.

1354
00:56:49.820 --> 00:56:52.029
- 孩子，吃点坚果。 - 优质蛋白质。

1355
00:56:52.167 --> 00:56:53.927
Growing boys need their protein.

1356
00:56:52.167 --> 00:56:53.927
正在长身体的男孩需要补充蛋白质。

1357
00:56:54.065 --> 00:56:55.722
Mommy says nuts make me fat.

1358
00:56:54.065 --> 00:56:55.722
妈妈说吃坚果会让我发胖。

1359
00:56:55.860 --> 00:56:58.449
What kind of a mother would say a thing like that?

1360
00:56:55.860 --> 00:56:58.449
什么样的母亲会说出这种话？

1361
00:56:59.554 --> 00:57:01.418
Okay, fine. Screw the nuts.

1362
00:56:59.554 --> 00:57:01.418
好吧，行。去他的螺母。

1363
00:57:02.280 --> 00:57:03.420
How old are you anyway?

1364
00:57:02.280 --> 00:57:03.420
你究竟多大了？

1365
00:57:03.558 --> 00:57:04.869
How much air do you think we have left?

1366
00:57:03.558 --> 00:57:04.869
你觉得我们还有多少氧气？

1367
00:57:05.007 --> 00:57:06.008
Almost eight.

1368
00:57:05.007 --> 00:57:06.008
快八小时了。

1369
00:57:06.146 --> 00:57:07.596
- You're seven. - It's too risky.

1370
00:57:06.146 --> 00:57:07.596
- 你七岁了。 - 这太冒险了。

1371
00:57:07.734 --> 00:57:09.356
I presume fully potty-trained.

1372
00:57:07.734 --> 00:57:09.356
我猜你已经完全学会上厕所了。

1373
00:57:09.495 --> 00:57:10.875
What, so just do nothing?

1374
00:57:09.495 --> 00:57:10.875
什么，就这么干等着？

1375
00:57:11.013 --> 00:57:12.774
The doors stay shut.

1376
00:57:11.013 --> 00:57:12.774
门一直锁着。

1377
00:57:12.912 --> 00:57:15.224
How old do you think I am? A hundred.

1378
00:57:12.912 --> 00:57:15.224
你觉得我多大年纪？一百岁。

1379
00:57:15.362 --> 00:57:16.571
Pretty close.

1380
00:57:15.362 --> 00:57:16.571
差不多。

1381
00:57:16.709 --> 00:57:18.365
Nobody is going to find us if we stay in here.

1382
00:57:16.709 --> 00:57:18.365
要是我们一直待在这儿，没人会找到我们。

1383
00:57:18.504 --> 00:57:20.816
Oh, great job, guys.

1384
00:57:18.504 --> 00:57:20.816
哦，干得漂亮，各位。

1385
00:57:20.954 --> 00:57:22.853
- Huh? - It's already getting stuffy.

1386
00:57:20.954 --> 00:57:22.853
- 嗯？ - 已经有点闷热了。

1387
00:57:22.991 --> 00:57:23.957
We could swim.

1388
00:57:22.991 --> 00:57:23.957
我们可以游泳。

1389
00:57:25.303 --> 00:57:28.893
I can go first, - swim down and find a way out. - No.

1390
00:57:25.303 --> 00:57:28.893
我可以先下去， - 游到下面找出口。 - 不行。

1391
00:57:29.031 --> 00:57:30.723
No, not on my watch. I can do it.

1392
00:57:29.031 --> 00:57:30.723
不行，在我值班期间绝不允许。让我来。

1393
00:57:30.861 --> 00:57:32.069
I know the plane better than you.

1394
00:57:30.861 --> 00:57:32.069
我比你更了解这架飞机。

1395
00:57:32.207 --> 00:57:33.898
And you have a broken wrist.

1396
00:57:32.207 --> 00:57:33.898
而你的手腕还断着。

1397
00:57:34.036 --> 00:57:35.935
Which you made better, remember?

1398
00:57:34.036 --> 00:57:35.935
是你治好的，记得吗？

1399
00:57:36.798 --> 00:57:38.420
Here, strap it.

1400
00:57:36.798 --> 00:57:38.420
来，绑上。

1401
00:57:40.871 --> 00:57:42.044
Come on.

1402
00:57:40.871 --> 00:57:42.044
来吧。

1403
00:57:42.182 --> 00:57:43.874
We don't have much time. Come on.

1404
00:57:42.182 --> 00:57:43.874
我们时间不多了。快点儿。

1405
00:57:45.910 --> 00:57:51.571
Okay. So, I'm gonna take a look around and then I'm gonna be back in a tick, okay?

1406
00:57:45.910 --> 00:57:51.571
好的。那我先四处看看，一会儿就回来，行吗？

1407
00:57:51.709 --> 00:57:52.745
Yeah? Yeah.

1408
00:57:51.709 --> 00:57:52.745
嗯？嗯。

1409
00:57:52.883 --> 00:57:54.471
Okay. Good.

1410
00:57:52.883 --> 00:57:54.471
好的。很好。

1411
00:57:56.542 --> 00:57:57.474
Don't go.

1412
00:57:56.542 --> 00:57:57.474
别走。

1413
00:58:00.200 --> 00:58:01.719
Hey, Finn.

1414
00:58:00.200 --> 00:58:01.719
嘿，芬恩。

1415
00:58:01.857 --> 00:58:04.308
You look after the ladies for me while I'm gone, yeah?

1416
00:58:01.857 --> 00:58:04.308
我不在的时候，替我照顾好女士们，好吗？

1417
00:58:05.965 --> 00:58:07.898
Okay, okay, okay.

1418
00:58:05.965 --> 00:58:07.898
好，好，好。

1419
00:58:13.455 --> 00:58:16.251
Hurry back... Matt.

1420
00:58:13.455 --> 00:58:16.251
快点回来……马特。

1421
00:58:17.666 --> 00:58:19.875
She remembered my name. Huh?

1422
00:58:17.666 --> 00:58:19.875
她记得我的名字。嗯？

1423
00:58:20.013 --> 00:58:21.498
Look, I've got a good feeling about us.

1424
00:58:20.013 --> 00:58:21.498
听着，我对我们俩很有信心。

1425
00:59:25.631 --> 00:59:26.666
Hey, hey!

1426
00:59:25.631 --> 00:59:26.666
嘿，嘿！

1427
00:59:26.804 --> 00:59:28.495
Hey, over here!

1428
00:59:26.804 --> 00:59:28.495
嘿，这边！

1429
00:59:29.427 --> 00:59:30.463
Help us!

1430
00:59:29.427 --> 00:59:30.463
快来帮帮我们！

1431
00:59:31.291 --> 00:59:33.570
Help! Over here!

1432
00:59:31.291 --> 00:59:33.570
救命！这边！

1433
00:59:33.708 --> 00:59:35.606
There's people that need help! Help!

1434
00:59:33.708 --> 00:59:35.606
有人需要帮助！救命！

1435
00:59:38.195 --> 00:59:39.368
My daughter, Cora.

1436
00:59:38.195 --> 00:59:39.368
我的女儿，科拉。

1437
00:59:46.341 --> 00:59:48.239
Help!

1438
00:59:46.341 --> 00:59:48.239
救命！

1439
00:59:52.727 --> 00:59:54.798
- Help! - How could this happen?

1440
00:59:52.727 --> 00:59:54.798
- 救命！ - 怎么会这样？

1441
00:59:58.353 --> 00:59:59.457
We're in the middle of nowhere.

1442
00:59:58.353 --> 00:59:59.457
我们身处荒郊野外。

1443
00:59:59.596 --> 01:00:00.562
How do you just fall out of the sky?

1444
00:59:59.596 --> 01:00:00.562
你怎么会从天上掉下来？

1445
01:00:00.700 --> 01:00:02.046
How long till they rescue us?

1446
01:00:00.700 --> 01:00:02.046
他们还要多久才能来救我们？

1447
01:00:02.184 --> 01:00:04.393
- Don't be a smart-ass. - Just answer the question.

1448
01:00:02.184 --> 01:00:04.393
- 别耍嘴皮子。 - 直接回答问题。

1449
01:00:04.531 --> 01:00:06.741
Look, I'll tell you what I know, okay?

1450
01:00:04.531 --> 01:00:06.741
听着，我把我知道的告诉你，行了吧？

1451
01:00:06.879 --> 01:00:08.328
Probably your fucking fault.

1452
01:00:06.879 --> 01:00:08.328
八成又是你的错。

1453
01:00:09.364 --> 01:00:11.090
You and this shitty airline.

1454
01:00:09.364 --> 01:00:11.090
你和这家破航空公司。

1455
01:00:11.228 --> 01:00:13.092
Look, you're angry, you want answers.

1456
01:00:11.228 --> 01:00:13.092
听着，你很生气，想要个说法。

1457
01:00:13.230 --> 01:00:14.680
You're gonna get them, okay?

1458
01:00:13.230 --> 01:00:14.680
你会得到的，好吗？

1459
01:00:17.268 --> 01:00:19.443
Truth is, we're lucky to be alive to blame somebody.

1460
01:00:17.268 --> 01:00:19.443
说实话，我们还能活着找人算账，已经是万幸了。

1461
01:00:21.410 --> 01:00:23.412
There were 257 souls on this flight.

1462
01:00:21.410 --> 01:00:23.412
这趟航班上有 257 条生命。

1463
01:00:25.483 --> 01:00:27.244
I count, maybe, 30 of us.

1464
01:00:25.483 --> 01:00:27.244
我数了数，大概只有我们 30 个人。

1465
01:00:30.419 --> 01:00:37.426
The way I see it, we have one job to do, and that is to get home to see our families.

1466
01:00:30.419 --> 01:00:37.426
在我看来，我们只有一个任务，那就是平安回家，见到我们的家人。

1467
01:00:37.564 --> 01:00:40.153
Okay, we have rafts. We need to get in them.

1468
01:00:37.564 --> 01:00:40.153
好了，我们有救生筏。我们得上去。

1469
01:00:40.291 --> 01:00:42.362
If you don't have a life jacket, take one from under a seat.

1470
01:00:40.291 --> 01:00:42.362
如果没有救生衣，请从座位下方取出一件。

1471
01:00:42.500 --> 01:00:44.192
Tell me your name. I'm Hutch.

1472
01:00:42.500 --> 01:00:44.192
告诉我你的名字。我是哈奇。

1473
01:00:44.330 --> 01:00:47.057
Hutch, I need you to pull out that second raft.

1474
01:00:44.330 --> 01:00:47.057
哈奇，我需要你把第二艘救生筏拉出来。

1475
01:00:47.195 --> 01:00:50.439
Everybody, help Hutch get the raft into the water.

1476
01:00:47.195 --> 01:00:50.439
大家，帮哈奇把救生筏放到水里。

1477
01:00:55.410 --> 01:00:57.584
It's stuck! It's stuck!

1478
01:00:55.410 --> 01:00:57.584
卡住了！卡住了！

1479
01:00:59.828 --> 01:01:01.140
Here, hold on to that.

1480
01:00:59.828 --> 01:01:01.140
来，抓住这个。

1481
01:01:01.278 --> 01:01:03.383
Cora, I need you to stay here, okay?

1482
01:01:01.278 --> 01:01:03.383
科拉，你得待在这里，好吗？

1483
01:01:03.521 --> 01:01:04.453
Stay away from the edge, all right?

1484
01:01:03.521 --> 01:01:04.453
离边缘远点，明白吗？

1485
01:01:04.591 --> 01:01:05.662
Okay.

1486
01:01:04.591 --> 01:01:05.662
好的。

1487
01:01:05.800 --> 01:01:07.077
I'm gonna go get something.

1488
01:01:05.800 --> 01:01:07.077
我去拿点东西。

1489
01:01:07.215 --> 01:01:08.941
Hey, everybody, be careful. The tide is moving fast.

1490
01:01:07.215 --> 01:01:08.941
嘿，大家小心点。潮水涨得很快。

1491
01:01:13.014 --> 01:01:14.153
Two, there...

1492
01:01:13.014 --> 01:01:14.153
二，那边……

1493
01:01:19.814 --> 01:01:21.816
All right, here we go. Ready?

1494
01:01:19.814 --> 01:01:21.816
好了，我们开始吧。准备好了吗？

1495
01:01:29.237 --> 01:01:30.307
I think we got it.

1496
01:01:29.237 --> 01:01:30.307
我觉得我们搞定了。

1497
01:01:46.254 --> 01:01:47.807
All right, ready? Ready?

1498
01:01:46.254 --> 01:01:47.807
好了，准备好了吗？准备好了吗？

1499
01:01:50.361 --> 01:01:51.362
Daddy.

1500
01:01:50.361 --> 01:01:51.362
爸爸。

1501
01:01:53.364 --> 01:01:55.366
Daddy!

1502
01:01:53.364 --> 01:01:55.366
爸爸！

1503
01:02:05.100 --> 01:02:06.999
Hey, come back! We need this! Let's go, let's go.

1504
01:02:05.100 --> 01:02:06.999
嘿，回来！我们需要这个！快走，快走。

1505
01:02:07.137 --> 01:02:10.174
Go. Go, go, go. Let's go. Let's get out of here.

1506
01:02:07.137 --> 01:02:10.174
走。快走，快走。我们走。我们离开这里。

1507
01:02:10.312 --> 01:02:12.487
Anybody, please, help me!

1508
01:02:10.312 --> 01:02:12.487
有人吗，求求你们，帮帮我！

1509
01:02:13.868 --> 01:02:15.110
Come on, baby.

1510
01:02:13.868 --> 01:02:15.110
来吧，宝贝。

1511
01:02:18.320 --> 01:02:19.425
We got this. Ready?

1512
01:02:18.320 --> 01:02:19.425
我们能行。准备好了吗？

1513
01:02:19.563 --> 01:02:20.875
Go, go, go.

1514
01:02:19.563 --> 01:02:20.875
冲，冲，冲。

1515
01:02:22.186 --> 01:02:24.948
We got this. One, two, three!

1516
01:02:22.186 --> 01:02:24.948
我们能行。一、二、三！

1517
01:02:25.086 --> 01:02:26.397
- Pull! - Daddy!

1518
01:02:25.086 --> 01:02:26.397
- 拉！ - 爸爸！

1519
01:02:26.535 --> 01:02:28.399
- Cora! - Pull!

1520
01:02:26.535 --> 01:02:28.399
- 科拉！ - 拉！

1521
01:02:28.537 --> 01:02:29.711
Get this onto a raft, don't drop it.

1522
01:02:28.537 --> 01:02:29.711
把这个放到木筏上，别掉了。

1523
01:02:29.849 --> 01:02:31.437
- Daddy! - Cora!

1524
01:02:29.849 --> 01:02:31.437
- 爸爸！ - 科拉！

1525
01:02:31.575 --> 01:02:33.646
- Let's get out of here. - Daddy, I'm sorry!

1526
01:02:31.575 --> 01:02:33.646
- 我们快离开这儿。 - 爸爸，对不起！

1527
01:02:34.785 --> 01:02:36.856
Cora! Cora! Come on. I'm sorry!

1528
01:02:34.785 --> 01:02:36.856
科拉！科拉！快走。对不起！

1529
01:02:38.824 --> 01:02:41.067
Get away from there! No, man, what are you doing?

1530
01:02:38.824 --> 01:02:41.067
离那儿远点！不，伙计，你在干什么？

1531
01:02:41.205 --> 01:02:42.310
Why didn't it open?

1532
01:02:41.205 --> 01:02:42.310
为什么打不开？

1533
01:02:42.448 --> 01:02:44.105
I don't know, pull the goddamn rope!

1534
01:02:42.448 --> 01:02:44.105
我不知道，快拉那该死的绳子！

1535
01:03:32.222 --> 01:03:33.154
Come on, come on.

1536
01:03:32.222 --> 01:03:33.154
快点，快点。

1537
01:03:36.122 --> 01:03:37.020
Come on.

1538
01:03:36.122 --> 01:03:37.020
加油。

1539
01:04:04.737 --> 01:04:05.703
Hey!

1540
01:04:04.737 --> 01:04:05.703
嘿！

1541
01:04:06.670 --> 01:04:07.878
Here!

1542
01:04:06.670 --> 01:04:07.878
这里！

1543
01:04:09.880 --> 01:04:11.537
The ELT.

1544
01:04:09.880 --> 01:04:11.537
应急定位发射器。

1545
01:04:11.675 --> 01:04:12.745
What?

1546
01:04:11.675 --> 01:04:12.745
什么？

1547
01:04:12.883 --> 01:04:15.196
The locator. That box I gave you. Where is it?

1548
01:04:12.883 --> 01:04:15.196
定位器。我给你的那个盒子。它在哪？

1549
01:04:21.236 --> 01:04:22.410
You gotta be kidding me.

1550
01:04:21.236 --> 01:04:22.410
你是在跟我开玩笑吧。

1551
01:04:23.583 --> 01:04:24.930
Come on, man, I was counting on you.

1552
01:04:23.583 --> 01:04:24.930
拜托，兄弟，我还指望你呢。

1553
01:04:25.068 --> 01:04:26.517
All you had to do was get it on the raft.

1554
01:04:25.068 --> 01:04:26.517
你只要把它弄到救生筏上就行。

1555
01:04:26.655 --> 01:04:29.417
Yeah, well, if it was so important, maybe you should've looked after it.

1556
01:04:26.655 --> 01:04:29.417
是啊，要是这东西真那么重要，你也许该自己看好它。

1557
01:04:29.555 --> 01:04:31.246
Locater? What's he talking about?

1558
01:04:29.555 --> 01:04:31.246
定位器？他在说什么？

1559
01:04:31.384 --> 01:04:33.731
Is that what they need to find us?

1560
01:04:31.384 --> 01:04:33.731
那是他们用来找我们的东西吗？

1561
01:04:33.870 --> 01:04:34.801
And you lost it?

1562
01:04:33.870 --> 01:04:34.801
你把它弄丢了？

1563
01:04:34.940 --> 01:04:37.494
Hey, don't put this on me, man.

1564
01:04:34.940 --> 01:04:37.494
嘿，别把责任推给我，老兄。

1565
01:04:37.632 --> 01:04:39.876
This was your responsibility, - Captain. - Hey!

1566
01:04:37.632 --> 01:04:39.876
这是你的责任，机长。 - 嘿！

1567
01:04:40.014 --> 01:04:41.463
- Over there! - Hey!

1568
01:04:40.014 --> 01:04:41.463
- 在那边！ - 嘿！

1569
01:04:42.602 --> 01:04:44.294
Here! Do you see them?

1570
01:04:42.602 --> 01:04:44.294
这里！你看到他们了吗？

1571
01:04:45.467 --> 01:04:47.228
Please, do something. No way.

1572
01:04:45.467 --> 01:04:47.228
拜托，想想办法。没门。

1573
01:04:47.366 --> 01:04:49.299
No, they can swim to the other raft.

1574
01:04:47.366 --> 01:04:49.299
不，他们可以游到另一个木筏上。

1575
01:04:49.437 --> 01:04:51.163
The current is too strong. They'll never make it.

1576
01:04:49.437 --> 01:04:51.163
水流太急了。他们根本过不去。

1577
01:04:51.301 --> 01:04:53.579
Can't you see we're already taking on water?

1578
01:04:51.301 --> 01:04:53.579
你没看到我们已经进水了吗？

1579
01:05:05.625 --> 01:05:10.458
Whoa... What... What... Oh, my God!

1580
01:05:05.625 --> 01:05:10.458
哇……什么……什么……哦，天哪！

1581
01:05:13.840 --> 01:05:15.083
Who the hell are you to decide?

1582
01:05:13.840 --> 01:05:15.083
你算老几，凭什么替我做决定？

1583
01:05:15.221 --> 01:05:18.328
I'm the captain. It's my plane.

1584
01:05:15.221 --> 01:05:18.328
我是机长，这是我的飞机。

1585
01:05:18.466 --> 01:05:19.812
Oh, that plane?

1586
01:05:18.466 --> 01:05:19.812
哦，那架飞机？

1587
01:05:20.468 --> 01:05:21.848
Great job. Huh?

1588
01:05:20.468 --> 01:05:21.848
干得漂亮，是吧？

1589
01:05:21.987 --> 01:05:24.334
People are dead because of you.

1590
01:05:21.987 --> 01:05:24.334
这些人因你而死。

1591
01:05:24.472 --> 01:05:27.993
And now you want to risk our lives to make yourself feel better?

1592
01:05:24.472 --> 01:05:27.993
现在你还要拿我们的命去冒险，就为了让你自己心里好受点？

1593
01:05:28.131 --> 01:05:30.133
No way. We stay put.

1594
01:05:28.131 --> 01:05:30.133
没门。我们就待着不动。

1595
01:05:42.869 --> 01:05:44.699
You call yourself a captain, huh?

1596
01:05:42.869 --> 01:05:44.699
就你这样还自称机长？

1597
01:05:46.114 --> 01:05:48.013
You can't even pilot a raft.

1598
01:05:46.114 --> 01:05:48.013
你连木筏都开不了。

1599
01:05:50.808 --> 01:05:52.810
We're going to get them.

1600
01:05:50.808 --> 01:05:52.810
我们会抓到他们的。

1601
01:05:52.949 --> 01:05:56.711
You know damn well what will happen to those two young men if we don't.

1602
01:05:52.949 --> 01:05:56.711
你他妈很清楚，如果我们不这么做，那两个年轻人会有什么下场。

1603
01:05:56.849 --> 01:05:58.333
Untether these rafts.

1604
01:05:56.849 --> 01:05:58.333
解开这些救生筏。

1605
01:06:03.166 --> 01:06:04.305
No! Hey!

1606
01:06:03.166 --> 01:06:04.305
不！嘿！

1607
01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:07.480
He hit me.

1608
01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:07.480
他打了我。

1609
01:06:07.618 --> 01:06:08.481
You're a witness.

1610
01:06:07.618 --> 01:06:08.481
你是个目击者。

1611
01:06:08.619 --> 01:06:11.139
Shut up, bitch.

1612
01:06:08.619 --> 01:06:11.139
闭嘴，贱人。

1613
01:06:12.658 --> 01:06:13.935
You heard the lady.

1614
01:06:12.658 --> 01:06:13.935
你听到这位女士的话了。

1615
01:06:14.073 --> 01:06:16.282
- And stop rocking the raft. - Let's go.

1616
01:06:14.073 --> 01:06:16.282
- 别晃船了。 - 我们走。

1617
01:06:25.153 --> 01:06:26.292
I want to go.

1618
01:06:25.153 --> 01:06:26.292
我想走了。

1619
01:06:26.430 --> 01:06:29.157
How much longer do we have to stay here?

1620
01:06:26.430 --> 01:06:29.157
我们还得在这里待多久？

1621
01:06:29.295 --> 01:06:31.470
I hope Matt hasn't swum away with a mermaid.

1622
01:06:29.295 --> 01:06:31.470
但愿马特没跟美人鱼游走了。

1623
01:06:33.299 --> 01:06:34.438
He wouldn't leave us.

1624
01:06:33.299 --> 01:06:34.438
他不会丢下我们的。

1625
01:06:56.115 --> 01:06:57.220
What's it waiting for?

1626
01:06:56.115 --> 01:06:57.220
还在等什么？

1627
01:06:59.256 --> 01:07:00.430
What's it waiting for?

1628
01:06:59.256 --> 01:07:00.430
还在等什么？

1629
01:07:17.102 --> 01:07:18.206
Let's get out of here.

1630
01:07:17.102 --> 01:07:18.206
我们离开这里吧。

1631
01:07:20.174 --> 01:07:22.279
Give me your hand. Come on.

1632
01:07:20.174 --> 01:07:22.279
把手给我。快。

1633
01:07:25.524 --> 01:07:26.490
Come on!

1634
01:07:25.524 --> 01:07:26.490
来吧！

1635
01:07:28.354 --> 01:07:30.425
Come on, come on, come on.

1636
01:07:28.354 --> 01:07:30.425
快点，快点，快点。

1637
01:07:39.848 --> 01:07:40.918
You two again, huh?

1638
01:07:39.848 --> 01:07:40.918
又是你们两个，嗯？

1639
01:07:45.544 --> 01:07:46.545
All right, let's get out of here.

1640
01:07:45.544 --> 01:07:46.545
好了，我们走吧。

1641
01:07:46.683 --> 01:07:47.787
Let's go.

1642
01:07:46.683 --> 01:07:47.787
走吧。

1643
01:07:53.483 --> 01:07:57.556
When we get outside the plane, we inflate our jackets.

1644
01:07:53.483 --> 01:07:57.556
等我们出了飞机，就充气穿上救生衣。

1645
01:07:57.694 --> 01:08:00.766
They'll take us straight up to the surface like a big balloon.

1646
01:07:57.694 --> 01:08:00.766
它们会像大号气球一样，直接把我们带到水面上。

1647
01:08:00.904 --> 01:08:02.906
No, I need a little more time.

1648
01:08:00.904 --> 01:08:02.906
不，我还需要一点时间。

1649
01:08:03.044 --> 01:08:04.770
You can't stay here.

1650
01:08:03.044 --> 01:08:04.770
你不能待在这里。

1651
01:08:04.908 --> 01:08:07.669
I can't take both of you. You can do it.

1652
01:08:04.908 --> 01:08:07.669
我不能同时带你们两个。你能做到的。

1653
01:08:07.807 --> 01:08:09.326
Doing this, doing that.

1654
01:08:07.807 --> 01:08:09.326
做这个，做那个。

1655
01:08:09.464 --> 01:08:12.191
I'm always trying to keep doing.

1656
01:08:09.464 --> 01:08:12.191
我总在努力继续做下去。

1657
01:08:12.329 --> 01:08:16.506
Ever since Bill died, it just gets old, you know?

1658
01:08:12.329 --> 01:08:16.506
自从比尔去世后，一切都变得索然无味，你明白吗？

1659
01:08:16.644 --> 01:08:19.336
Becky, I'm sorry. I am. But we have to go now.

1660
01:08:16.644 --> 01:08:19.336
贝基，我很抱歉。真的。但我们现在必须走了。

1661
01:08:19.474 --> 01:08:21.821
No, I know. You take Finn.

1662
01:08:19.474 --> 01:08:21.821
不，我知道。你带芬恩去吧。

1663
01:08:21.959 --> 01:08:23.651
No! You come, too. Please.

1664
01:08:21.959 --> 01:08:23.651
不行！你也一起来。求你了。

1665
01:08:23.789 --> 01:08:26.032
You stay strong, hotshot.

1666
01:08:23.789 --> 01:08:26.032
坚持住，王牌飞行员。

1667
01:08:26.171 --> 01:08:29.208
I admire your style. Don't worry about me.

1668
01:08:26.171 --> 01:08:29.208
我欣赏你的作风。别担心我。

1669
01:08:33.350 --> 01:08:36.250
I will come back, Becky. I promise.

1670
01:08:33.350 --> 01:08:36.250
我会回来的，贝琪。我保证。

1671
01:08:37.803 --> 01:08:39.425
You okay? Yeah?

1672
01:08:37.803 --> 01:08:39.425
你还好吗？真的吗？

1673
01:08:40.046 --> 01:08:41.324
Good boy.

1674
01:08:40.046 --> 01:08:41.324
好孩子。

1675
01:09:47.976 --> 01:09:49.530
Matt!

1676
01:09:47.976 --> 01:09:49.530
马特！

1677
01:09:56.675 --> 01:09:57.917
We can make it.

1678
01:09:56.675 --> 01:09:57.917
我们能赶上的。

1679
01:09:59.540 --> 01:10:04.890
So, Captain, do you have a plan that doesn't rely on just dumb luck?

1680
01:09:59.540 --> 01:10:04.890
那么，机长，你有没有什么计划不是光靠运气就能行？

1681
01:10:05.960 --> 01:10:06.995
You know, we're alive.

1682
01:10:05.960 --> 01:10:06.995
你知道吗，我们都还活着。

1683
01:10:08.204 --> 01:10:09.619
We're all alive.

1684
01:10:08.204 --> 01:10:09.619
我们都还活着。

1685
01:10:12.932 --> 01:10:13.968
You got kids?

1686
01:10:12.932 --> 01:10:13.968
你有孩子吗？

1687
01:10:18.006 --> 01:10:19.318
Yeah.

1688
01:10:18.006 --> 01:10:19.318
有。

1689
01:10:20.354 --> 01:10:22.701
My daughter, Terri.

1690
01:10:20.354 --> 01:10:22.701
我的女儿，泰瑞。

1691
01:10:22.839 --> 01:10:25.945
My little boy, Sean.

1692
01:10:22.839 --> 01:10:25.945
我的小儿子，肖恩。

1693
01:10:26.083 --> 01:10:27.257
Well, I got three.

1694
01:10:26.083 --> 01:10:27.257
嗯，我有三个孩子。

1695
01:10:28.431 --> 01:10:29.880
Youngest is five.

1696
01:10:28.431 --> 01:10:29.880
最小的五岁。

1697
01:10:31.399 --> 01:10:33.677
I can tell you they ain't growing up without me.

1698
01:10:31.399 --> 01:10:33.677
我可以告诉你，他们不可能在没有我的情况下长大。

1699
01:10:35.196 --> 01:10:43.342
So, whatever you gotta do to make yourself feel better about losing all those people back there... but don't use me, pal.

1700
01:10:35.196 --> 01:10:43.342
所以，不管你做什么来让自己对失去那些人感觉好受些……但别利用我，伙计。

1701
01:10:45.241 --> 01:10:48.934
Because I'm going home... whatever it takes.

